 is unlikely ever to end up being  one-sided  who is weak and who is powerful changes  rapidly and frequently you're likely to  be as it were a patron in one area and a  beggar in another so we must be kind not  only because we are touched by the  suffering of others but because we  properly understand that we too will  soon be in urgent need of an equally  vital dose of charity in some other part  of our lives  you
 

